The Type 3 at medium confidence holds up: the case against Type 7 is argued fairly and Type 9 is properly tested. Evidence would clear 8 once the two errors are fixed. Whether the repaired draft reaches 8.5 overall depends on the length trim too.

**Research tasks still open:** a human listen at about 48:15 in the podcast to settle "irreverence" vs "reverence"; checking the 2017 Hillsong photo claim if it gets used; and three carried over from research (Anna Faris's podcast audio, the original Entertainment Weekly coach quote, the SmartLess audio).

I also saved a memory note: the editor's fixes are never seen by the reviewers, so verify should diff the draft against the candidate and recheck every sentence the editor added.
